flowchart LR
  P[Model proposal] --> L1[1 · Closed action set<br/>6 allowed actions]
  L1 --> L2[2 · Constrained decoding<br/>target ∈ investigated services]
  L2 --> L3[3 · Citation validation<br/>only gathered evidence]
  L3 --> L4[4 · Policy interlocks<br/>no rollback without a running recent deploy]
  L4 --> L5{5 · Human approval}
  L5 -->|approved| L6[6 · Capability<br/>this action · this target · once · 5 min]
  L6 --> L7[7 · Verification<br/>probe: success ≥ 95%, p95 < 1 s]
  L7 -->|healthy| OK[RESOLVED + TTM]
  L7 -. not healthy .-> FAIL[REMEDIATION_FAILED<br/>stays open for a human]
  IN[Tool output] --> S0[0 · Input sanitization<br/>PII redaction · injection removal]
  S0 --> P
  L4 -. violation .-> ESC[Downgrade to escalate<br/>+ recorded guardrail event]
